title: Guest 4. Save portfolio changes
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Browser as Next.js Client<br/>(Browser)
    participant Dexie as Local Persistence<br/>(Dexie / IndexedDB)

    Note over User,Browser: Trigger: User creates, renames,<br/>or edits a guest portfolio
    Note over Browser,Dexie: Guest portfolios remain<br/>local to this browser

    alt User creates a portfolio
        User->>Browser: Create portfolio
        Browser->>Dexie: Save the new portfolio
        Dexie-->>Browser: Save acknowledged
        Browser-->>User: Display the portfolio
    else User renames or edits a portfolio
        User->>Browser: Change portfolio data
        alt Manual save
            User->>Browser: Select Save
            Browser->>Dexie: Save portfolio changes
        else Autosave is enabled
            Browser->>Browser: Wait for the autosave debounce
            Browser->>Dexie: Save portfolio changes
        end
        Dexie-->>Browser: Save acknowledged
        Browser-->>User: Show Saved
    end
